{"text": "578001830\n\nMEMORANDUM\nTo Hugh Honeycutt\nVello Norman\nLeslie Lewis\nDallas Pinion\nFROM: James A. Goold\n\nDATE: May 4, 1992\n\nAttached is a draft set of tables responding to Roy\nDeppa's request for additional information on the industry\nstudies. Would each of you please review this with some care\nand make any corrections or additions that are necessary for\nyour study or studies? You will also see that there are\nblanks that need to be filled in. I suggest that you mark up\nthe draft and return it to me. I will circulate the next\ndraft incorporating your corrections to the entire Joint\n\nVenture.\n\n578001830\n\nPRODUCED FROM B&W WEB SITE", "words": [{"text": "578001830", "x0": 1, "y0": 955, "x1": 79, "y1": 964, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "MEMORANDUM", "x0": 336, "y0": 90, "x1": 419, "y1": 99, "conf": 70.0}, {"text": "To", "x0": 114, "y0": 109, "x1": 135, "y1": 137, "conf": 60.0}, {"text": "Hugh", "x0": 203, "y0": 119, "x1": 235, "y1": 131, "conf": 95.0}, {"text": "Honeycutt", "x0": 245, "y0": 119, "x1": 318, "y1": 131, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "Vello", "x0": 202, "y0": 133, "x1": 244, "y1": 142, "conf": 82.0}, {"text": "Norman", "x0": 253, "y0": 134, "x1": 302, "y1": 142, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "Leslie", "x0": 203, "y0": 147, "x1": 252, "y1": 156, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "Lewis", "x0": 261, "y0": 147, "x1": 301, "y1": 156, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "Dallas", "x0": 202, "y0": 161, "x1": 251, "y1": 170, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "Pinion", "x0": 261, "y0": 161, "x1": 310, "y1": 170, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "FROM:", "x0": 114, "y0": 179, "x1": 157, "y1": 207, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "James", "x0": 202, "y0": 189, "x1": 243, "y1": 198, "conf": 95.0}, {"text": "A.", "x0": 253, "y0": 189, "x1": 266, "y1": 198, "conf": 92.0}, {"text": "Goold", "x0": 278, "y0": 189, "x1": 318, "y1": 198, "conf": 95.0}, {"text": "DATE:", "x0": 114, "y0": 207, "x1": 157, "y1": 236, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "May", "x0": 202, "y0": 217, "x1": 227, "y1": 229, "conf": 96.0}, {"text":